<title>SOUTH KOREA: Shindongbang buys 35,000T U.S. soybean.</title>
<headline>Shindongbang buys 35,000T U.S. soybean.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Shindongbang Corp has bought 35,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 soybean at a basis price over March futures on the Chicago Board of Trade, a senior official of the company said on Monday.</p>
